                  Parameters for GAMV
                  *******************

START OF PARAMETERS:
grid_3d.dat   \file with data
1 2 3   \columns for X, Y, Z coordinates
1 4   \number of variables, column numbers
-1.0e21 1.0e21   \trimming limits
gamv.out   \file for variogram output
6   \number of lags
1   \lag separation distance
0.5   \lag tolerance
5   \number of directions
90.0 10.0 1e21 26.565 10.0 1e21   \azm,atol,bandh,dip,dtol,bandv
90.0 10.0 1e21 -26.565 10.0 1e21   \azm,atol,bandh,dip,dtol,bandv
0.0 90.0 1e21 -90.0 10.0 1e21   \azm,atol,bandh,dip,dtol,bandv
0.0 30.0 0.5 0.0 30.0 0.5   \azm,atol,bandh,dip,dtol,bandv
45.0 0.0 1e21 0.0 0.0 1e21   \azm,atol,bandh,dip,dtol,bandv
0   \standardize sills? (0=no, 1=yes)
2   \number of variograms
1 1 1   \tail var., head var., variogram type
1 1 8   \tail var., head var., variogram type
